# Copy to .env for local `astro dev` / `npm run build`. Astro/Vite only expose
# PUBLIC_-prefixed vars to client-side code — see README.md "Pricing / FastSpring checkout".
#
# PUBLIC_FASTSPRING_STOREFRONT is the storefront + embedded checkout path, e.g.
# "callmarta.test.onfastspring.com/embedded-pricing" for the test store, or
# "callmarta.onfastspring.com/embedded-pricing" once live. pricing.astro fails the build
# if this is unset, so you never ship a page silently missing checkout.
PUBLIC_FASTSPRING_STOREFRONT=callmarta.test.onfastspring.com/embedded-pricing
